  "prefLabel": "He-C 6344.24 Denial of Application and Revocation of a CMHP Provider Certification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6344.24 Denial of Application and Revocation of a CMHP Provider Certification. An application for CMHP provider certification shall be denied or certification revoked if:\n\n(a) There has been failure to comply with He-C 6344;\n\n(b) There has been failure to comply with He-M 426; and\n\n(c) There has been termination of the contract with the DBH.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-C 6344) #9311, eff 11-5-08; ss by #12206, eff 6-10-17 (from He-C 6344.29)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-c6300.html"
